        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IIEg">II Eg</ref> 2.3</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Gelæste man sulhælmessan þonne XV niht beon onufan eastran.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">Plough-alms shall be rendered 15 days after Easter.</ab>
